          "start": 52,
          "end": 53,
          "lines": [
            "Open `project/RollBallStarter.uproject` with Unreal Engine 5.7.4. The starter presents a small inert 3D mesh and material display with real lighting and a patterned rotating sphere. It deliberately contains no playable ball, movement, active traps, completion flow, gameplay restart, or game-state provider. Its read-only bridge reports `provider_ready=false` and `game_state=null`.\n"
          ]
        },
